          "id": "R02"
        },
        {
          "body": "Bind permission to publish decoded values to the visit that received the frame. src/subscription.js permits Promise decoding and explicitly states that listener removal does not stop an existing decode. On close or replacement, retire that visit and check its permission immediately before publication. Check pending completion after close and switch while preserving active-visit delivery.",
