          "body": "Establish retirement and cleanup ownership before startup can publish. src/workspace-navigation.js explicitly permits publication to synchronously switch or hide the panel. An older startup returning afterward must not overwrite the resulting visit's cleanup ownership. Check inline switch and hide, subsequent updates, and eventual cleanup.",
          "category": "event_relation",
          "id": "R04"
        },
        {
          "body": "Give each opening an independent lifetime even when it reuses the same transport. src/workspace-navigation.js explicitly supports transport reuse. Check that pending results from a retired opening remain suppressed while the later opening receives bootstrap and updates.",
          "category": "event_relation",
          "id": "R05"
        },
