          "body": "Scope the ordering repair to the presence subscription. The task forbids changing the metrics consumer, and src/metrics-consumer.js deliberately relies on attaching after synchronous bootstrap to count deltas only. Check that presence gains bootstrap delivery while metrics retain their existing output.",
