      "rules": [
        {
          "body": "Apply when immediate document writes become reusable trailing work, document buffers outlive visible subscriptions, and save callbacks can synchronously navigate. Confirm any departure deadline separately. README.md: \"A workspace document buffer persists independently of the current view badge. Save callbacks can synchronously navigate.\"",
