        {
          "body": "Bind accepted edits to their originating document's reusable trailing task, replace pending text, restart the quiet interval on every edit, and preserve the no-current-view guard. TASK: \"Coalesce edits using the existing trailing-task utility: after a 120 ms quiet\ninterval, write only the latest text in that editing burst. Subsequent bursts\nmust continue to save.\" src/coordinator.js: \"trailing(env.timers,120,text=>env.store.write(id,text))\". src/services.js: \"push(text) { if (ticket !== null) timers.cancel(ticket); value = text; ticket = timers.schedule(flush, wait); },\"",
